{
 "scope": "Codimension-m WEIGHTED SLICE MEASURABILITY, and the CODIMENSION-m REGULAR COAREA FORMULA it assembles - the analogue of the scalar L9. NOT the general codimension-m coarea formula: nothing about the critical set, and no slice measurability without the regularity hypothesis. No hole migrated. The log-concave Cheeger-Buser line belongs to collaborator Wang Haocheng and was not touched.",
 "head": "34b92695ece4f636a1a7f1eafbbf41c685ee0348",
